# Privacy Compliance Assessment – ABC FinTech

## Overview

A simulated privacy compliance assessment of a fictional fintech company, focusing on how personal data is collected, processed, stored, and shared.

## Objectives

- Identify personal data processed by the organisation.
- Analyse the purpose of processing.
- Identify potential privacy risks.
- Recommend appropriate privacy controls.

## Scope

The assessment covers customer data, KYC information, transaction data, communications, and security-related data.

## Framework

The assessment is based on general data protection principles, with reference to the **DPDP Act, 2023**.

## Tools

- Microsoft Excel
- GitHub
- Power BI

> This is a fictional educational project and does not constitute legal advice.

